        </defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Not Duplicate</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Is_Duplicate</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Is_Asset_In_String</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Loop_Through_Assets</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Is Duplicate</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>06/03/26 (GD) – Replaces DLRS Roll_Up_Asset_Numbers_to_Loaner rule on create. Concatenates distinct ProductItem__c.Name values onto Loaner__c.Loaner_Asset__c when a ProductItem is created with a Loaner. Entry criteria and Loaner_Is_Null_Check prevent SOQL when Loaner__c is blank. Writes null when result is empty.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>Is_Asset_In_String</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>CONTAINS(&quot;,&quot; &amp; {!Concatenated_Asset} &amp; &quot;,&quot;, &quot;,&quot; &amp; {!Loop_Through_Assets.Name} &amp; &quot;,&quot;)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>Is_Result_Blank</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>ISBLANK({!Trimmed_Asset})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>Trimmed_Asset</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(RIGHT({!Concatenated_Asset}, 1) = &quot;,&quot;, LEFT({!Concatenated_Asset}, LEN({!Concatenated_Asset}) - 1), {!Concatenated_Asset})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>ProductItem | Asynchronous, on create, Loaner Asset Number Roll Up {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>ProductItem | Asynchronous, on create, Loaner Asset Number Roll Up</label>
